    "verdict": [
      "The degradation columns are a formula, not a measurement: Avg_Deg_pct = clip(100 × power_loss ÷ power_consumed) (R² 1.000 on held-out stations).",
      "Without power loss, ridge regression explains R² 0.55 — but only because current and power sit in the formula's denominator (largest weight: inverse_current). That is arithmetic, not wear.",
      "Removing those too leaves R² -0.01: no other column carries information about degradation.",
      "The dataset has no independently measured degradation label, so no degradation predictor is deployed from it."
